          id: '1', 
          name: 'Texto Livre', 
          type: 'text', 
          content: 'Seu texto aqui', 
          x: 10, 
          y: 10, 
          w: 80, 
          h: 10, 
          zIndex: 10, 
          style: { fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'normal', color: '#000000', textAlign: 'left', fontFamily: 'Inter' } 
      }
  ];

  const [config, setConfig] = useState<AgendaConfig>({
    year: initialConfig?.year || new Date().getFullYear() + 1,
    layoutType: initialConfig?.layoutType || '1_per_page',
    pageSize: initialConfig?.pageSize || 'A5',
    orientation: initialConfig?.orientation || 'portrait',
    includeHolidays: initialConfig?.includeHolidays ?? true,
    includeMoonPhases: initialConfig?.includeMoonPhases ?? false,
    includeQuotes: initialConfig?.includeQuotes ?? false,
    mirrorEvenPages: initialConfig?.mirrorEvenPages ?? true,
    margins: initialConfig?.margins || { top: 15, bottom: 15, inside: 20, outside: 10 },
    elements: initialConfig?.elements && initialConfig.elements.length > 0 ? initialConfig.elements : getDefaultElements(),
    introPages: initialConfig?.introPages || [
        { id: 'intro-1', name: 'Dados Pessoais', elements: [{ id: 'ip1', type: 'text', content: 'DADOS PESSOAIS', name: 'Título', x: 10, y: 10, w: 80, h: 10, zIndex: 1, style: { fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', textAlign: 'center', color: '#333' } }] }
    ]
  });

  const [generatedData, setGeneratedData] = useState<DayData[]>([]);
  const [quotes, setQuotes] = useState<string[]>([]);
  const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState<string | null>(null);
  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<'editor' | 'preview'>('editor');
  const [showMargins, setShowMargins] = useState(true);
  const [customFonts, setCustomFonts] = useState<string[]>([]);
  const [variantModal, setVariantModal] = useState<{type: ElementType, label: string} | null>(null);
  const [editorViewMode, setEditorViewMode] = useState<'standard' | 'weekend'>('standard');

  const [renderedPreviewCount, setRenderedPreviewCount] = useState(0); 
  const [printStatus, setPrintStatus] = useState<'idle' | 'generating' | 'downloading'>('idle');
  const [printProgress, setPrintProgress] = useState(0);

  const [showLayers, setShowLayers] = useState(false);
  const [showProperties, setShowProperties] = useState(true);
  const [showAlignment, setShowAlignment] = useState(false);

  const [isDragging, setIsDragging] = useState(false);
  const [resizeDir, setResizeDir] = useState<string | null>(null);
  const [resizingTableCol, setResizingTableCol] = useState<{ elementId: string, colIndex: number } | null>(null);
  const [activeTableCell, setActiveTableCell] = useState<{ r: number, c: number } | null>(null);
  const [fontControlTab, setFontControlTab] = useState<'title' | 'weekDays' | 'days' | 'highlight'>('title');

  const [editMode, setEditMode] = useState<'daily' | 'intro'>('daily');
  const [currentIntroPageId, setCurrentIntroPageId] = useState<string | null>(config.introPages[0]?.id || null);

  const dragRef = useRef<any>(null);
  const editorRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);

  useEffect(() => {
      if (activeTab === 'preview') {
          if (renderedPreviewCount < generatedData.length) {
              const timer = setTimeout(() => {
                  setRenderedPreviewCount(prev => Math.min(prev + 20, generatedData.length));
              }, 10);
              return () => clearTimeout(timer);
          }
      } else {
          if (renderedPreviewCount > 0) setRenderedPreviewCount(0);
      }
  }, [activeTab, renderedPreviewCount, generatedData.length]);

  const handlePrintRequest = async () => {
      setPrintStatus('generating');
      setPrintProgress(0);
      try {
          await generateAndDownloadPDF(config, generatedData, quotes, (progress) => {
              setPrintProgress(progress);
          });
          setPrintStatus('downloading');
          setTimeout(() => {
              setPrintStatus('idle');
              setPrintProgress(0);
          }, 1000);
      } catch (error) {
          console.error("PDF Generation Error", error);
          alert("Erro ao gerar o PDF.");
          setPrintStatus('idle');
      }
  };

  const cancelPrint = () => {
      setPrintStatus('idle');
      setPrintProgress(0);
  };

  useEffect(() => {
    const handleKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {
        if ((e.key === 'Delete' || e.key === 'Backspace')) {
            const activeElement = document.activeElement;
            const isInputActive = activeElement && (
                activeElement.tagName === 'INPUT' || 
                activeElement.tagName === 'TEXTAREA' || 
                (activeElement as HTMLElement).isContentEditable
            );
            if (!isInputActive && selectedId) removeElement(selectedId);
        }
    };
    window.addEventListener('keydown', handleKeyDown);
    return () => window.removeEventListener('keydown', handleKeyDown);
  }, [selectedId, config]); 

  const getPageDimensions = () => {
      const base = PAGE_SIZES_MM[config.pageSize];
      if (config.orientation === 'portrait') return base;
      return { width: base.height, height: base.width };
  };

  const { width: PAGE_WIDTH_MM, height: PAGE_HEIGHT_MM } = getPageDimensions();
  const EDITOR_WIDTH_PX = 400; 
  const EDITOR_SCALE = EDITOR_WIDTH_PX / PAGE_WIDTH_MM;
  const EDITOR_HEIGHT_PX = PAGE_HEIGHT_MM * EDITOR_SCALE;

  useEffect(() => {
    setGeneratedData(generateCalendarYear(config.year, config.includeHolidays));
  }, [config.year, config.includeHolidays]);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (config.includeQuotes && quotes.length === 0) {
       generateMonthlyQuotes(config.year).then(setQuotes);
    }
  }, [config.includeQuotes, config.year]);

  useEffect(() => {
      if (selectedId) setShowProperties(true);
  }, [selectedId]);

  const getActiveElements = () => {
      if (editMode === 'daily') return config.elements;
      if (editMode === 'intro' && currentIntroPageId) {
          return config.introPages.find(p => p.id === currentIntroPageId)?.elements || [];
      }
      return [];
  };

  const updateActiveElements = (newElements: LayoutElement[]) => {
      if (editMode === 'daily') {
          setConfig(prev => ({ ...prev, elements: newElements }));
      } else if (editMode === 'intro' && currentIntroPageId) {
          setConfig(prev => ({
              ...prev,
              introPages: prev.introPages.map(p => p.id === currentIntroPageId ? { ...p, elements: newElements } : p)
          }));
      }
  };

  const alignElement = (type: 'left' | 'center' | 'right' | 'top' | 'middle' | 'bottom') => {
      if (!selectedId) return;
      const activeList = getActiveElements();
      const element = activeList.find(el => el.id === selectedId);
      if (!element) return;
      const newEl = { ...element };
      switch(type) {
          case 'left': newEl.x = 0; break;
          case 'center': newEl.x = 50 - (newEl.w / 2); break;
          case 'right': newEl.x = 100 - newEl.w; break;
          case 'top': newEl.y = 0; break;
          case 'middle': newEl.y = 50 - (newEl.h / 2); break;
          case 'bottom': newEl.y = 100 - newEl.h; break;
      }
      updateActiveElements(activeList.map(el => el.id === selectedId ? newEl : el));
  };

  const fitToText = () => {
      if (!selectedId) return;
      const activeList = getActiveElements();
      const element = activeList.find(el => el.id === selectedId);
      if (!element || !element.content) return;
      const charCount = element.content.length;
      const fontSize = element.style.fontSize || 14;
      const estWidthPx = charCount * (fontSize * 0.6); 
      const estWidthPercent = (estWidthPx / EDITOR_WIDTH_PX) * 100;
      const newWidth = Math.min(90, Math.max(10, estWidthPercent));
      const newHeight = Math.max(5, (fontSize * 1.5 * (Math.ceil(estWidthPercent/90)) / EDITOR_HEIGHT_PX) * 100);
      updateActiveElements(activeList.map(el => el.id === selectedId ? { ...el, w: newWidth, h: newHeight } : el));
  };

  const addIntroPage = () => {
      const newPage = { id: Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9), name: `Página ${config.introPages.length + 1}`, elements: [] };
      setConfig(prev => ({ ...prev, introPages: [...prev.introPages, newPage] }));
      setCurrentIntroPageId(newPage.id);
  };

  const renameIntroPage = (id: string, name: string) => {
      setConfig(prev => ({ ...prev, introPages: prev.introPages.map(p => p.id === id ? { ...p, name } : p) }));
  };

  const deleteIntroPage = (id: string) => {
      setConfig(prev => {
          const newPages = prev.introPages.filter(p => p.id !== id);
          if (currentIntroPageId === id) setCurrentIntroPageId(newPages[0]?.id || null);
          return { ...prev, introPages: newPages };
      });
  };

  const addElement = (type: ElementType, label: string, styleOverride: any = {}, sizeOverride: any = {}) => {
    const activeList = getActiveElements();
    const newElement: LayoutElement = {
      id: Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9),
      type,
      name: `${label} ${activeList.length + 1}`,
      x: 35, y: 40, w: sizeOverride.w || 20, h: sizeOverride.h || 10, zIndex: activeList.length + 1,
      style: { fontSize: 14, color: '#000000', textAlign: 'left', lineSpacing: 24, borderColor: '#000000', borderWidth: 1, backgroundColor: 'transparent', rotation: 0, opacity: 1, flipX: false, flipY: false, fontFamily: 'Inter', showTimes: false, startHour: 7, borderStyle: 'solid', ...styleOverride }
    };
    if (type === 'text') { newElement.content = "Novo Texto"; }
    const defaultCalendarStyle = {
        title: { fontSize: 10, fontFamily: 'Inter', fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#000', textAlign: 'center' as const, textTransform: 'uppercase' as const, letterSpacing: 1 },
        weekDays: { fontSize: 7, fontFamily: 'Inter', fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#666', textAlign: 'center' as const, textTransform: 'uppercase' as const, letterSpacing: 0 },
        days: { fontSize: 8, fontFamily: 'Inter', fontWeight: 'normal', color: '#333', textAlign: 'center' as const, textTransform: 'none' as const, letterSpacing: 0 },
        grid: { borderColor: '#dddddd', borderWidth: 0.5, cellBackgroundColor: 'transparent', headerBackgroundColor: 'transparent', borders: { top: false, bottom: false, left: false, right: false, insideHorizontal: false, insideVertical: false, headerSeparator: true } },
        specialDays: { highlightSundays: true, highlightHolidays: false, style: { fontSize: 8, fontFamily: 'Inter', fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#dc2626', textAlign: 'center' as const, textTransform: 'none' as const, letterSpacing: 0, backgroundColor: 'transparent' } }
    };
    if (!sizeOverride.w) {
        if (type === 'lines') { newElement.w = 80; newElement.h = 40; newElement.x = 10; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'box') { newElement.w = 30; newElement.h = 15; newElement.style.backgroundColor = '#f3f4f6'; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'circle') { newElement.w = 15; newElement.h = 15; newElement.style.backgroundColor = '#e0e7ff'; newElement.style.borderRadius = 999; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'day_number') { newElement.w = 15; newElement.h = 10; newElement.style.fontSize = 32; newElement.style.fontWeight = 'bold'; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'text') { newElement.w = 30; newElement.h = 8; newElement.style.fontSize = 16; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'holiday') { newElement.w = 40; newElement.h = 5; newElement.style.fontSize = 10; newElement.style.color = '#ef4444'; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; newElement.style.fontWeight = '500'; }
        if (type === 'moon') { newElement.w = 20; newElement.h = 5; newElement.style.fontSize = 12; newElement.style.color = '#6b7280'; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'vector_flower') { newElement.w = 20; newElement.h = 20; newElement.style.color = '#1f2937'; newElement.style.backgroundColor = '#e5e7eb'; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'habit_tracker') { newElement.w = 40; newElement.h = 15; newElement.style.borderWidth = 1; newElement.style.borderColor = '#d1d5db'; }
        if (type === 'note_grid') { newElement.w = 40; newElement.h = 20; newElement.style.opacity = 0.5; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; }
        if (type === 'mini_calendar') { newElement.w = 25; newElement.h = 18; newElement.style.calendarOffset = 0; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; newElement.style.fullCalendar = defaultCalendarStyle; }
        if (type === 'full_calendar') { newElement.w = 90; newElement.h = 80; newElement.x = 5; newElement.y = 10; newElement.style.borderWidth = 0; newElement.style.monthsPerRow = 3; newElement.style.gap = 15; newElement.style.fullCalendar = { ...defaultCalendarStyle, title: { ...defaultCalendarStyle.title, fontSize: 14 }, weekDays: { ...defaultCalendarStyle.weekDays, fontSize: 9 }, days: { ...defaultCalendarStyle.days, fontSize: 10 }, specialDays: { ...defaultCalendarStyle.specialDays, style: { ...defaultCalendarStyle.specialDays.style, fontSize: 10, backgroundColor: '#fee2e2' } } }; }
        if (type === 'table') { newElement.w = 80; newElement.h = 40; newElement.x = 10; newElement.style.borderWidth = 1; newElement.style.borderColor = '#d1d5db'; newElement.style.table = { rows: 10, cols: 2, borderColor: '#d1d5db', borderWidth: 1, headerRow: true, columnWidths: [50, 50], cellContent: {}, textStyle: { fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 10, fontWeight: 'normal', color: '#4b5563', textAlign: 'left', verticalAlign: 'top', textTransform: 'none', letterSpacing: 0 }, rowStyles: {}, colStyles: {}, borders: { top: true, bottom: true, left: true, right: true, insideHorizontal: true, insideVertical: true, headerSeparator: true } }; }
    }
    if (type === 'holiday') setConfig(prev => ({ ...prev, includeHolidays: true }));
    if (type === 'moon') setConfig(prev => ({ ...prev, includeMoonPhases: true }));
    if (type === 'quote') setConfig(prev => ({ ...prev, includeQuotes: true }));
    updateActiveElements([...activeList, newElement]);
    setSelectedId(newElement.id);
    setVariantModal(null);
  };

  const removeElement = (id: string) => {
    const activeList = getActiveElements();
    updateActiveElements(activeList.filter(e => e.id !== id));
    setSelectedId(null);
  };

  const moveLayer = (id: string, direction: 'up' | 'down') => {
      const activeList = getActiveElements();
      const index = activeList.findIndex(e => e.id === id);
      if (index === -1) return;
      if (direction === 'up' && index === activeList.length - 1) return;
      if (direction === 'down' && index === 0) return;
      const newElements = [...activeList];
      const swapIndex = direction === 'up' ? index + 1 : index - 1;
      [newElements[index], newElements[swapIndex]] = [newElements[swapIndex], newElements[index]];
      updateActiveElements(newElements.map((el, i) => ({ ...el, zIndex: i + 1 })));
  };

  const updateElementStyle = (id: string, styleUpdate: any) => {
    updateActiveElements(getActiveElements().map(e => e.id === id ? { ...e, style: { ...e.style, ...styleUpdate } } : e));
  };

  const updateElementContent = (id: string, content: string) => {
    updateActiveElements(getActiveElements().map(e => e.id === id ? { ...e, content } : e));
  };

  const updateTableConfig = (id: string, tableUpdate: any) => {
      const element = getActiveElements().find(e => e.id === id);
      if (!element || !element.style.table) return;
      let newTableStyle = { ...element.style.table, ...tableUpdate };
      if (tableUpdate.cols) {
          const newCols = tableUpdate.cols;
          const oldCols = element.style.table.cols;
          if (newCols > oldCols) newTableStyle.columnWidths = Array(newCols).fill(100 / newCols);
          else if (newCols < oldCols) newTableStyle.columnWidths = newTableStyle.columnWidths?.slice(0, newCols) || Array(newCols).fill(100/newCols);
      }
      updateElementStyle(id, { table: newTableStyle });
  }

  const handleInteractionStart = (e: React.MouseEvent, id: string, dir: string | null = null) => {
    if (activeTab === 'preview') return;
    e.stopPropagation();
    const element = getActiveElements().find(el => el.id === id);
    if (!element) return;
    setSelectedId(id);
    dragRef.current = { startX: e.clientX, startY: e.clientY, initialX: element.x, initialY: element.y, initialW: element.w, initialH: element.h };
    if (dir) setResizeDir(dir); else setIsDragging(true);
  };

  const handleMouseMove = (e: React.MouseEvent) => {
    if (resizingTableCol && dragRef.current && selectedId) {
        // ... Lógica de resize de tabela simplificada
        return;
    }
    if ((!isDragging && !resizeDir) || !dragRef.current || !selectedId || !editorRef.current) return;
    const editorRect = editorRef.current.getBoundingClientRect();
    const deltaX = e.clientX - dragRef.current.startX;
    const deltaY = e.clientY - dragRef.current.startY;
    let newElement = { ...getActiveElements().find(el => el.id === selectedId)! };
    if (isDragging) {
        const { x, y } = calculateDragPosition(deltaX, deltaY, dragRef.current.initialX, dragRef.current.initialY, editorRect.width, editorRect.height);
        newElement.x = x; newElement.y = y;
    } else if (resizeDir) {
        const { x, y, w, h } = calculateResize(deltaX, deltaY, dragRef.current.initialX, dragRef.current.initialY, dragRef.current.initialW, dragRef.current.initialH, editorRect.width, editorRect.height, resizeDir);
        newElement.x = x; newElement.y = y; newElement.w = w; newElement.h = h;
    }
    updateActiveElements(getActiveElements().map(el => el.id === selectedId ? newElement : el));
  };

  const renderTemplate = (elements: LayoutElement[], day: DayData | null, isEditor: boolean = false, attachRef: boolean = false) => {
    const d = day || { dayOfMonth: 24, month: 7, year: config.year, dayOfWeek: 3, holiday: 'Feriado', moonPhase: 'Lua cheia', date: new Date() } as DayData;
    return (
      <div ref={attachRef ? editorRef : null} className="relative overflow-hidden w-full h-full" onMouseMove={isEditor ? handleMouseMove : undefined} onMouseUp={() => {setIsDragging(false); setResizeDir(null);}} onMouseLeave={() => {setIsDragging(false); setResizeDir(null);}}>
        {elements.map(el => {
          const isSelected = isEditor && selectedId === el.id;
          const wrapperStyle: React.CSSProperties = { left: `${el.x}%`, top: `${el.y}%`, width: `${el.w}%`, height: `${el.h}%`, zIndex: el.zIndex, transform: `rotate(${el.style.rotation || 0}deg) scaleX(${el.style.flipX ? -1 : 1}) scaleY(${el.style.flipY ? -1 : 1})` };
          return (
            <div key={el.id} onMouseDown={(e) => handleInteractionStart(e, el.id)} className={`absolute group ${isSelected ? 'ring-2 ring-indigo-500 z-50' : 'hover:ring-1 hover:ring-indigo-300'}`} style={wrapperStyle}>
                <div className="w-full h-full relative flex items-center" style={{ justifyContent: el.style.textAlign === 'center' ? 'center' : (el.style.textAlign === 'right' ? 'flex-end' : 'flex-start'), ...(['lines','box','circle','table'].includes(el.type) ? {} : el.style) }}>
                    <ElementRenderer element={el} dayData={d} quote={quotes[d.month]} isEditor={isEditor} isSelected={isSelected} onContentChange={updateElementContent} />
                </div>
            </div>
          );
        })}
      </div>
    );
  };

  const renderEditorPage = () => {
    const paddingStyle = { paddingTop: `${config.margins.top * EDITOR_SCALE}px`, paddingBottom: `${config.margins.bottom * EDITOR_SCALE}px`, paddingLeft: `${config.margins.inside * EDITOR_SCALE}px`, paddingRight: `${config.margins.outside * EDITOR_SCALE}px` };
    const containerStyle = { width: `${EDITOR_WIDTH_PX}px`, height: `${EDITOR_HEIGHT_PX}px`, ...paddingStyle };
    return <div className="bg-white shadow-2xl relative flex flex-col" style={containerStyle}><div className={`w-full h-full relative ${showMargins ? 'outline outline-1 outline-dashed outline-indigo-300' : ''}`}>{renderTemplate(getActiveElements(), null, true, true)}</div></div>;
  };

  return (
    <div className="h-screen flex flex-col bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden font-sans no-print">
      {/* Overlay de Geração de PDF */}
      {printStatus !== 'idle' && (
          <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[100] bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center flex-col text-white p-6">
              <div className="w-full max-w-md bg-white/10 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-2xl flex flex-col items-center">
                    <Loader2 className="w-12 h-12 animate-spin mb-6 text-indigo-400" />
                    <h2 className="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Portal do Aluno: Gerando PDF</h2>
                    <p className="text-sm opacity-60 mb-6 text-center">Processando páginas... {printProgress}%</p>
                    <div className="w-full h-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-8">
                        <div className="h-full bg-indigo-500 transition-all duration-300" style={{ width: `${printProgress}%` }}></div>
                    </div>
                    <button onClick={cancelPrint} className="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors border border-white/10">Cancelar</button>
              </div>
          </div>
      )}

      {/* Header Premium Acadêmico */}
      <header className="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 h-16 flex items-center justify-between px-6 z-20 shrink-0">
        <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div className="bg-indigo-600 p-2 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-100">
                <GraduationCap className="h-5 w-5 text-white" />
            </div>
            <div className="flex flex-col">
                <span className="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm leading-tight">Portal do Aluno</span>
                <span className="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">AgendaMaster AI</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div className="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-xl">
            <button onClick={() => setActiveTab('editor')} className={`px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition-all ${activeTab === 'editor' ? 'bg-white shadow-sm text-indigo-600' : 'text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700'}`}>Editor</button>
            <button onClick={() => setActiveTab('preview')} className={`px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition-all ${activeTab === 'preview' ? 'bg-white shadow-sm text-indigo-600' : 'text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700'}`}>Visualizar</button>
        </div>

        <div className="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div className="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-3 pr-4 border-r border-slate-100 text-right">
                <div className="flex flex-col">
                    <span className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">{user.name}</span>
                    <span className="text-[9px] text-indigo-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Acesso Estudante Pro</span>
                </div>
                <div className="w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border border-indigo-100">
                    <UserIcon className="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <button onClick={handlePrintRequest} disabled={printStatus !== 'idle'} className="flex items-center gap-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/20 disabled:opacity-50">
                <FileDown className="w-4 h-4" /> Exportar PDF
            </button>
            <button onClick={onLogout} className="p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500 transition-colors"><LogOut className="w-5 h-5" /></button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div className="flex-1 flex overflow-hidden">
        {/* Sidebar com Estilo Estudantil */}
        <aside className="w-72 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col shrink-0 z-10 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
            <div className="p-6 border-b border-slate-100">
                <h3 className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">Estrutura da Agenda</h3>
                <div className="flex flex-col gap-2">
                    <button onClick={() => setEditMode('daily')} className={`flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all border ${editMode === 'daily' ? 'bg-indigo-50 border-indigo-200 text-indigo-700' : 'bg-transparent border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-50'}`}>
                        <FileText className="w-4 h-4" /> Layout Diário
                    </button>
                    <button onClick={() => setEditMode('intro')} className={`flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all border ${editMode === 'intro' ? 'bg-indigo-50 border-indigo-200 text-indigo-700' : 'bg-transparent border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-50'}`}>
                        <BookOpen className="w-4 h-4" /> Páginas Iniciais
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div className="p-6">
                <h3 className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">Ferramentas Criativas</h3>
                <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                    <button onClick={() => addElement('text', 'Texto')} className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl transition-all border border-slate-100 hover:border-indigo-200 group">
                        <Type className="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-indigo-600 mb-2" />
                        <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 group-hover:text-indigo-700">TEXTO</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onClick={() => setVariantModal({type: 'day_number', label: 'Número'})} className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl transition-all border border-slate-100 hover:border-indigo-200 group">
                        <span className="text-lg font-black text-slate-400 group-hover:text-indigo-600 mb-1 leading-none">24</span>
                        <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 group-hover:text-indigo-700">DATA</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onClick={() => addElement('lines', 'Pautas')} className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl transition-all border border-slate-100 hover:border-indigo-200 group">
                        <ListTodo className="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-indigo-600 mb-2" />
                        <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 group-hover:text-indigo-700">PAUTAS</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onClick={() => addElement('table', 'Horários')} className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl transition-all border border-slate-100 hover:border-indigo-200 group">
                        <TableIcon className="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-indigo-600 mb-2" />
                        <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 group-hover:text-indigo-700">TABELA</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onClick={() => addElement('habit_tracker', 'Tracker')} className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl transition-all border border-slate-100 hover:border-indigo-200 group">
                        <CheckCircle2 className="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-indigo-600 mb-2" />
                        <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 group-hover:text-indigo-700">HÁBITOS</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onClick={() => addElement('mini_calendar', 'Mini Calendário')} className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl transition-all border border-slate-100 hover:border-indigo-200 group">
                        <CalendarDays className="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-indigo-600 mb-2" />
                        <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 group-hover:text-indigo-700">MINI CAL</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>

        {/* Editor Central */}
        <main className="flex-1 bg-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 relative">
            <div className="absolute top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center gap-4 z-10">
                <button onClick={() => setShowLayers(!showLayers)} className={`flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-sm ${showLayers ? 'bg-indigo-600 text-white' : 'bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50'}`}>
                    <Layers className="w-4 h-4" /> Camadas
                </button>
                <button onClick={() => setShowMargins(!showMargins)} className={`flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-sm ${showMargins ? 'bg-indigo-600 text-white' : 'bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50'}`}>
                    <ScanLine className="w-4 h-4" /> Margens
                </button>
            </div>

            <div className="flex-1 w-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-auto custom-scrollbar p-12">
                {activeTab === 'editor' ? renderEditorPage() : <div className="text-slate-400">Mude para aba Editor para gerenciar o miolo.</div>}
            </div>
        </main>

        {/* Propriedades do Elemento */}
        <aside className="w-80 bg-white border-l border-slate-200 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar p-6">
            <h3 className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-6">Propriedades</h3>
            {selectedId ? (
                <div className="space-y-6 animate-in slide-in-from-right-4 duration-300">
                    <div className="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
                        <label className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase block mb-2">Nome do Objeto</label>
                        <input 
                            type="text" 
                            className="w-full bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500/20"
                            value={getActiveElements().find(e => e.id === selectedId)?.name || ''}
                            onChange={(e) => updateActiveElements(getActiveElements().map(el => el.id === selectedId ? {...el, name: e.target.value} : el))}
                        />
                    </div>
                    {/* Controles de estilo aqui... */}
                    <div className="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
                        <button onClick={() => removeElement(selectedId)} className="w-full py-3 rounded-xl text-red-500 bg-red-50 hover:bg-red-100 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all">
                            <Trash2 className="w-4 h-4" /> Remover Elemento
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            ) : (
                <div className="h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center opacity-30">
                    <Layout className="w-12 h-12 mb-4" />
                    <p className="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest leading-loose">Selecione algo <br/>para editar</p>
                </div>
            )}
        </aside>
      </div>

      {/* Variant Modal */}
      {variantModal && (
          <div className="absolute inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm px-4" onClick={() => setVariantModal(null)}>
              <div className="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-lg p-6 animate-in zoom-in-95 duration-200" onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()}>
                  <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
                    <h3 className="text-sm font-black text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-widest">Estilos de {variantModal.label}</h3>
                    <button onClick={() => setVariantModal(null)} className="p-1 hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-full transition-colors"><X className="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400" /></button>
                  </div>
                  <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                      {ELEMENT_VARIANTS[variantModal.type]?.map((variant, idx) => (
                          <div key={idx} onClick={() => addElement(variantModal.type, variantModal.label, variant.styleOverride, variant.defaultSize)} className="group p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-50 cursor-pointer transition-all">
                              <span className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-indigo-700 mb-1">{variant.name}</span>
                              <span className="block text-[10px] text-slate-400">{variant.description}</span>
                          </div>
                      ))}
                  </div>
              </div>
          </div>
      )}
    </div>
  );
};
